      "created_at": "2017-04-24T19:11:57Z",
      "updated_at": "2017-04-24T19:11:57Z",
      "body": "@lomky you are definitely right that we want to know whether someone had an alt contact or not, and that we don't want to know the PII of that person. Relationship is a little borderline and I think I'd rather err on the side of not saving it. \r\n\r\nre: persisting other contact info, in #1004 we're rolling out a `has_other_contact?` convenience method. Maybe we can have that as a persisted boolean field, and have it as part of a `after_save` hook.\r\n\r\nLove the idea of an 'archive' field blacklist to deal with nuking sensitive fields.",
