      "body": "Rehashing our conversation from a few days ago, but setting an env var is no problem, and almost definitely the right way to go. We have a `secret_key_base` that rails uses as part of its engine for generating tokens etc, or we can separately set an `ARCHIVING_ENCRYPTION_SALT` for this. \r\n\r\nIf there winds up not being a fab way to do this then we can consult with @vtmeghan about a halfway solution, or explore just punting this business need entirely. Let's keep that in our back pocket in case we need it.",
