      "updated_at": "2017-05-20T17:12:13Z",
      "body": "Talked to cm team about this more. We think it could be useful to explore a two part archival process. @lomky told me about a way for us to automatically trigger archival after fulfillment data is entered in the profile. It would make sense to have a shorter archive/scramble timeline for pt profiles where the fulfillment data has already been entered. But, we might want a longer timeline for pt profiles that have an appt date but do not have fulfillment data entered yet. Apologies if this is already obvious and/or being discussed somewhere else. Thoughts, @colinxfleming and @lwaldsc ? ",
